2026-11-07T11:58:51.4234575Z [0m
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4234883Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4235247Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4235391Z 
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4235798Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4236174Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4236404Z 
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4236554Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4236874Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4237016Z 
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4237808Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [30001..30008])[0m and groups [34m(gid 30000)[0m
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4238305Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4238723Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4239147Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4239235Z 
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4239337Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4239468Z 
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4239568Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4239766Z    can use Nix.
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4239837Z 
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4239983Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4240063Z 
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4240496Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4240866Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4253192Z 
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4253585Z I will:
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4254047Z 
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4254292Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4254722Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4255424Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4255911Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4256346Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4256710Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4257235Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4257658Z    /root
2026-11-07T11:58:51.4261783Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
